[00:12.078] Went for a drink at the bar down the road
[00:16.949] Watching horses and betting your clothes
[00:23.607] You head out the door then to go for a smoke
[00:28.456] It hit on the way out and stubbed you your toe
[00:35.122] A guy rounds the corner in a fisherman's hat
[00:39.967] And he hits ya in the face with a baseball bat
[00:48.148] He took one look at you after he stopped to laugh
[00:53.349] And he noticed he mistook you, got hit on behalf
[00:58.240] Of some bastard from the bar who had slept with his wife
[01:02.702] You said, "I never seen you in my God given life"
[01:07.638] You stood up and brushed off and felt for your mouth
[01:12.550] And your teeth had leapt from you, so you spit 'em all out
[01:17.317] You took up your pride, and you took up the bat
[01:22.067] And you went for that shithead, took out his knee caps
[01:27.890]
[01:46.894] You went to the dentist, and he winced at your gums
[01:50.842] And he said that false teeth were your only option
[01:55.790] You said, "Go ahead, man, just take out the rest
[02:00.572] Even the good ones are doomed, I'm tired of them"
[02:05.321] The dentist took pause but said, "Seems fine to me"
[02:10.327] And that's how you got dentures at age 33
[02:14.958] You told me this story as you stood by your truck
[02:19.745] I said "Gary, man, you have the worst of all luck
[02:24.871] I always did wonder how your teeth stayed so nice
[02:29.250] When the only thing you drink is Pepsi"
